OL,5,G1929 Celebration
OL,6,     FCelebration comes for the
OL,7,     FEvangelical Movement of Wales's
OL,8,     Fsummer conference in Aberystwyth,
OL,9,     Frecorded in 2025.
OL,10,G2000 Celtic Heartbeat
OL,11,     FFrank Hennessy presents the best
OL,12,     Fin folk, roots and acoustic music
OL,13,     Ffrom the Celtic countries and
OL,14,     Fbeyond.
OL,15,G2200 Beverley's World of Music
OL,16,     FThe finest musical melodies,
OL,17,     Fexquisite performances from stage
OL,18,     Fand screen, and orchestral and
OL,19,     Fchoral works from Wales and the
OL,20,     Fworld. There's no need to book
OL,21,     Fyour seat, just listen and relax.
